@BookItNepal_HostAddress = http://localhost:5066
@orgSlug = your-organization-slug

POST {{BookItNepal_HostAddress}}/api/{{orgSlug}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "9800000000",
  "password": "replace-with-password"
}

### Refresh the session using the refreshToken cookie from login
POST {{BookItNepal_HostAddress}}/api/{{orgSlug}}/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json

### Log out and revoke the refreshToken cookie
POST {{BookItNepal_HostAddress}}/api/{{orgSlug}}/auth/logout
